  "exported_at": "2026-08-15T15:30:33.841Z",
  "notebook": {
    "id": "default",
    "name": "Pembersihan dan Manipulasi Data (Data Wrangling) dengan Tidyverse",
    "autoNameNumber": null,
    "description": "",
    "kernelLanguage": "python",
    "catalogId": null,
    "catalogRevision": null,
    "cellCounter": 17,
    "cells": [
      {
        "id": 1,
        "code": "# Pembersihan dan Manipulasi Data (Data Wrangling) dengan Tidyverse\n\nSaluran data lintas bahasa: Python mengunduh data → R memproses dengan dplyr → Python memvisualisasikan hasil.\n\nMendemonstrasikan **SharedVFS** — sistem file bersama yang memungkinkan Python dan R bertukar file.",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "markdown",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      },
      {
        "id": 2,
        "code": "## 1. Python: Unduh Kumpulan Data",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "markdown",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      },
      {
        "id": 3,
        "code": "import micropip\nawait micropip.install('pandas')\nimport pandas as pd, pyodide.http, os\n\nurl = \"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/resbaz/r-novice-gapminder-files/master/data/gapminder-FiveYearData.csv\"\nresp = await pyodide.http.pyfetch(url)\ntext = await resp.string()\n\nos.makedirs(\"/shared/data\", exist_ok=True)\nwith open(\"/shared/data/gapminder.csv\", \"w\") as f:\n    f.write(text)\n\ndf = pd.read_csv(\"/shared/data/gapminder.csv\")\nprint(f\"Diunduh: {df.shape[0]} baris, {df.shape[1]} kolom\")\ndf.head()",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "python",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "Diunduh: 1704 baris, 6 kolom\n       country  year         pop continent  lifeExp   gdpPercap\n0  Afghanistan  1952   8425333.0      Asia   28.801  779.445314\n1  Afghanistan  1957   9240934.0      Asia   30.332  820.853030\n2  Afghanistan  1962  10267083.0      Asia   31.997  853.100710\n3  Afghanistan  1967  11537966.0      Asia   34.020  836.197138\n4  Afghanistan  1972  13079460.0      Asia   36.088  739.981106",
        "lastOutputHtml": "<pre class=\"text-result\" dir=\"ltr\">Diunduh: 1704 baris, 6 kolom\n</pre><pre class=\"text-result\" dir=\"ltr\">       country  year         pop continent  lifeExp   gdpPercap\n0  Afghanistan  1952   8425333.0      Asia   28.801  779.445314\n1  Afghanistan  1957   9240934.0      Asia   30.332  820.853030\n2  Afghanistan  1962  10267083.0      Asia   31.997  853.100710\n3  Afghanistan  1967  11537966.0      Asia   34.020  836.197138\n4  Afghanistan  1972  13079460.0      Asia   36.088  739.981106</pre>"
      },
      {
        "id": 4,
        "code": "## 2. R: Pasang dplyr + tidyr dan baca data bersama",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "markdown",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      },
      {
        "id": 5,
        "code": "install.packages(c(\"dplyr\", \"tidyr\"))\nlibrary(dplyr)\n\ngap <- read.csv(\"/shared/data/gapminder.csv\")\ncat(\"Dibaca dari SharedVFS:\", nrow(gap), \"baris\\n\")\nglimpse(gap)",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "r",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "Dibaca dari SharedVFS: 1704 baris\nRows: 1,704\nColumns: 6\n$ country   <chr> \"Afghanistan\", \"Afghanistan\", \"Afghanistan\", \"Afghanistan\", …\n$ year      <int> 1952, 1957, 1962, 1967, 1972, 1977, 1982, 1987, 1992, 1997, …\n$ pop       <dbl> 8425333, 9240934, 10267083, 11537966, 13079460, 14880372, 12…\n$ continent <chr> \"Asia\", \"Asia\", \"Asia\", \"Asia\", \"Asia\", \"Asia\", \"Asia\", \"Asi…\n$ lifeExp   <dbl> 28.801, 30.332, 31.997, 34.020, 36.088, 38.438, 39.854, 40.8…\n$ gdpPercap <dbl> 779.4453, 820.8530, 853.1007, 836.1971, 739.9811, 786.1134, …",
        "lastOutputHtml": "<pre class=\"text-result\" dir=\"ltr\">Dibaca dari SharedVFS: 1704 baris\nRows: 1,704\nColumns: 6\n$ country   &lt;chr&gt; \"Afghanistan\", \"Afghanistan\", \"Afghanistan\", \"Afghanistan\", …\n$ year      &lt;int&gt; 1952, 1957, 1962, 1967, 1972, 1977, 1982, 1987, 1992, 1997, …\n$ pop       &lt;dbl&gt; 8425333, 9240934, 10267083, 11537966, 13079460, 14880372, 12…\n$ continent &lt;chr&gt; \"Asia\", \"Asia\", \"Asia\", \"Asia\", \"Asia\", \"Asia\", \"Asia\", \"Asi…\n$ lifeExp   &lt;dbl&gt; 28.801, 30.332, 31.997, 34.020, 36.088, 38.438, 39.854, 40.8…\n$ gdpPercap &lt;dbl&gt; 779.4453, 820.8530, 853.1007, 836.1971, 739.9811, 786.1134, …</pre>"
      },
      {
        "id": 6,
        "code": "## 3. dplyr: Ringkas berdasarkan Benua (2007)",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "markdown",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      },
      {
        "id": 7,
        "code": "gap %>%\n  filter(year == 2007) %>%\n  group_by(continent) %>%\n  summarize(\n    countries = n(),\n    mean_life = round(mean(lifeExp), 1),\n    median_gdp = round(median(gdpPercap), 0),\n    total_pop = sum(as.numeric(pop))\n  ) %>%\n  arrange(desc(mean_life))",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "r",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "# A tibble: 5 × 5\n  continent countries mean_life median_gdp  total_pop\n  <chr>         <int>     <dbl>      <dbl>      <dbl>\n1 Oceania           2      80.7      29810   24549947\n2 Europe           30      77.6      28054  586098529\n3 Americas         25      73.6       8948  898871184\n4 Asia             33      70.7       4471 3811953827\n5 Africa           52      54.8       1452  929539692",
        "lastOutputHtml": "<pre class=\"text-result\" dir=\"ltr\"># A tibble: 5 × 5\n  continent countries mean_life median_gdp  total_pop\n  &lt;chr&gt;         &lt;int&gt;     &lt;dbl&gt;      &lt;dbl&gt;      &lt;dbl&gt;\n1 Oceania           2      80.7      29810   24549947\n2 Europe           30      77.6      28054  586098529\n3 Americas         25      73.6       8948  898871184\n4 Asia             33      70.7       4471 3811953827\n5 Africa           52      54.8       1452  929539692</pre>"
      },
      {
        "id": 8,
        "code": "## 4. dplyr: Peningkatan Angka Harapan Hidup Terbesar",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "markdown",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      },
      {
        "id": 9,
        "code": "gains <- gap %>%\n  filter(year %in% c(1952, 2007)) %>%\n  select(country, continent, year, lifeExp) %>%\n  tidyr::pivot_wider(names_from = year, values_from = lifeExp,\n                     names_prefix = \"y\") %>%\n  mutate(gain = y2007 - y1952) %>%\n  arrange(desc(gain)) %>%\n  head(10)\ngains",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "r",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "# A tibble: 10 × 5\n   country            continent y1952 y2007  gain\n   <chr>              <chr>     <dbl> <dbl> <dbl>\n 1 Oman               Asia       37.6  75.6  38.1\n 2 Vietnam            Asia       40.4  74.2  33.8\n 3 Indonesia          Asia       37.5  70.6  33.2\n 4 Saudi Arabia       Asia       39.9  72.8  32.9\n 5 Libya              Africa     42.7  74.0  31.2\n 6 Korea Rep.         Asia       47.5  78.6  31.2\n 7 Nicaragua          Americas   42.3  72.9  30.6\n 8 West Bank and Gaza Asia       43.2  73.4  30.3\n 9 Yemen Rep.         Asia       32.5  62.7  30.2\n10 Gambia             Africa     30    59.4  29.4",
        "lastOutputHtml": "<pre class=\"text-result\" dir=\"ltr\"># A tibble: 10 × 5\n   country            continent y1952 y2007  gain\n   &lt;chr&gt;              &lt;chr&gt;     &lt;dbl&gt; &lt;dbl&gt; &lt;dbl&gt;\n 1 Oman               Asia       37.6  75.6  38.1\n 2 Vietnam            Asia       40.4  74.2  33.8\n 3 Indonesia          Asia       37.5  70.6  33.2\n 4 Saudi Arabia       Asia       39.9  72.8  32.9\n 5 Libya              Africa     42.7  74.0  31.2\n 6 Korea Rep.         Asia       47.5  78.6  31.2\n 7 Nicaragua          Americas   42.3  72.9  30.6\n 8 West Bank and Gaza Asia       43.2  73.4  30.3\n 9 Yemen Rep.         Asia       32.5  62.7  30.2\n10 Gambia             Africa     30    59.4  29.4</pre>"
      },
      {
        "id": 10,
        "code": "## 5. dplyr: Pertumbuhan Populasi berdasarkan Benua",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "markdown",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      },
      {
        "id": 11,
        "code": "pop_growth <- gap %>%\n  filter(year %in% c(1952, 2007)) %>%\n  group_by(continent, year) %>%\n  summarize(total_pop = sum(as.numeric(pop)), .groups = \"drop\") %>%\n  tidyr::pivot_wider(names_from = year, values_from = total_pop,\n                     names_prefix = \"pop_\") %>%\n  mutate(growth_pct = round((pop_2007 / pop_1952 - 1) * 100, 1)) %>%\n  arrange(desc(growth_pct))\npop_growth",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "r",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "# A tibble: 5 × 4\n  continent    pop_1952   pop_2007 growth_pct\n  <chr>           <dbl>      <dbl>      <dbl>\n1 Africa     237640501   929539692      291. \n2 Asia      1395357352. 3811953827      173. \n3 Americas   345152446   898871184      160. \n4 Oceania     10686006    24549947      130. \n5 Europe     418120846   586098529       40.2",
        "lastOutputHtml": "<pre class=\"text-result\" dir=\"ltr\"># A tibble: 5 × 4\n  continent    pop_1952   pop_2007 growth_pct\n  &lt;chr&gt;           &lt;dbl&gt;      &lt;dbl&gt;      &lt;dbl&gt;\n1 Africa     237640501   929539692      291. \n2 Asia      1395357352. 3811953827      173. \n3 Americas   345152446   898871184      160. \n4 Oceania     10686006    24549947      130. \n5 Europe     418120846   586098529       40.2</pre>"
      },
      {
        "id": 12,
        "code": "## 6. R: Tulis Hasil ke SharedVFS",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "markdown",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      },
      {
        "id": 13,
        "code": "# Tulis ringkasan benua untuk divisualisasikan oleh Python\nsummary_2007 <- gap %>%\n  filter(year == 2007) %>%\n  group_by(continent) %>%\n  summarize(\n    mean_life = round(mean(lifeExp), 1),\n    mean_gdp = round(mean(gdpPercap), 0),\n    .groups = \"drop\"\n  )\nwrite.csv(summary_2007, \"/shared/data/r_summary.csv\", row.names = FALSE)\ncat(\"Menulis /shared/data/r_summary.csv\\n\")\nsummary_2007",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "r",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "Menulis /shared/data/r_summary.csv\n# A tibble: 5 × 3\n  continent mean_life mean_gdp\n  <chr>         <dbl>    <dbl>\n1 Africa         54.8     3089\n2 Americas       73.6    11003\n3 Asia           70.7    12473\n4 Europe         77.6    25054\n5 Oceania        80.7    29810",
        "lastOutputHtml": "<pre class=\"text-result\" dir=\"ltr\">Menulis /shared/data/r_summary.csv\n# A tibble: 5 × 3\n  continent mean_life mean_gdp\n  &lt;chr&gt;         &lt;dbl&gt;    &lt;dbl&gt;\n1 Africa         54.8     3089\n2 Americas       73.6    11003\n3 Asia           70.7    12473\n4 Europe         77.6    25054\n5 Oceania        80.7    29810</pre>"
      },
      {
        "id": 14,
        "code": "## 7. Python: Visualisasikan Hasil R",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "markdown",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      },
      {
        "id": 15,
        "code": "import micropip\nawait micropip.install('plotly')\nimport plotly.express as px\nimport json, js\nfrom plotly.utils import PlotlyJSONEncoder\n\ndef plain_plotly(value):\n    if hasattr(value, 'tolist'):\n        return value.tolist()\n    if isinstance(value, dict):\n        return {key: plain_plotly(item) for key, item in value.items()}\n    if isinstance(value, (list, tuple)):\n        return [plain_plotly(item) for item in value]\n    return value\n\ndef show_plotly(fig):\n    payload = plain_plotly(fig.to_plotly_json())\n    js.renderPlot(json.dumps({\"traces\": payload[\"data\"], \"layout\": payload[\"layout\"]}, cls=PlotlyJSONEncoder))\n\nr_summary = pd.read_csv(\"/shared/data/r_summary.csv\")\nprint(\"Dibaca dari SharedVFS (ditulis oleh R):\")\nprint(r_summary.to_string(index=False))\n\nfig = px.bar(r_summary, x=\"continent\", y=\"mean_life\",\n             title=\"Rata-rata Angka Harapan Hidup berdasarkan Benua (2007) — dari R → Python\",\n             labels={\"mean_life\": \"Angka Harapan Hidup (tahun)\", \"continent\": \"Benua\"},\n             color=\"continent\")\nfig.update_layout(template='plotly_dark', showlegend=False)\nshow_plotly(fig)",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "python",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "AfricaAmericasAsiaEuropeOceania020406080Rata-rata Angka Harapan Hidup berdasarkan Benua (2007) — dari R → PythonBenuaAngka Harapan Hidup (tahun)Dibaca dari SharedVFS (ditulis oleh R):\ncontinent  mean_life  mean_gdp\n   Africa       54.8      3089\n Americas       73.6     11003\n     Asia       70.7     12473\n   Europe       77.6     25054\n  Oceania       80.7     29810\n",
        "lastOutputHtml": "<div class=\"plot-container js-plotly-plot\"><div class=\"plot-container plotly\"><div class=\"user-select-none svg-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; height: 100%;\"><svg class=\"main-svg\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"654\" height=\"250\" style=\"background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\"><defs id=\"defs-24ce97\"><g class=\"clips\"><clipPath id=\"clip24ce97xyplot\" class=\"plotclip\"><rect width=\"583\" height=\"167\"></rect></clipPath><clipPath class=\"axesclip\" id=\"clip24ce97x\"><rect x=\"51\" y=\"0\" width=\"583\" height=\"250\"></rect></clipPath><clipPath class=\"axesclip\" id=\"clip24ce97y\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"30\" width=\"654\" height=\"167\"></rect></clipPath><clipPath class=\"axesclip\" id=\"clip24ce97xy\"><rect x=\"51\" y=\"30\" width=\"583\" height=\"167\"></rect></clipPath></g><g class=\"gradients\"></g><g class=\"patterns\"></g></defs><g class=\"bglayer\"><rect class=\"bg\" x=\"51\" y=\"30\" width=\"583\" height=\"167\" style=\"fill: rgb(22, 27, 34); fill-opacity: 1; stroke-width: 0;\"></rect></g><g class=\"draglayer cursor-crosshair\"><g class=\"xy\"><rect class=\"nsewdrag drag\" data-subplot=\"xy\" x=\"51\" y=\"30\" width=\"583\" height=\"167\" style=\"fill: transparent; stroke-width: 0; pointer-events: all;\"></rect><rect class=\"nwdrag drag cursor-nw-resize\" data-subplot=\"xy\" x=\"31\" y=\"10\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"fill: transparent; stroke-width: 0; pointer-events: all;\"></rect><rect class=\"nedrag drag cursor-ne-resize\" data-subplot=\"xy\" x=\"634\" y=\"10\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"fill: transparent; stroke-width: 0; pointer-events: all;\"></rect><rect class=\"swdrag drag cursor-sw-resize\" data-subplot=\"xy\" x=\"31\" y=\"197\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"fill: transparent; stroke-width: 0; pointer-events: all;\"></rect><rect class=\"sedrag drag cursor-se-resize\" data-subplot=\"xy\" x=\"634\" y=\"197\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"fill: transparent; stroke-width: 0; pointer-events: all;\"></rect><rect class=\"ewdrag drag cursor-ew-resize\" data-subplot=\"xy\" x=\"109.30000000000001\" y=\"197.5\" width=\"466.40000000000003\" height=\"20\" style=\"fill: transparent; stroke-width: 0; pointer-events: all;\"></rect><rect class=\"wdrag drag cursor-w-resize\" data-subplot=\"xy\" x=\"51\" y=\"197.5\" width=\"58.300000000000004\" height=\"20\" style=\"fill: transparent; stroke-width: 0; pointer-events: all;\"></rect><rect class=\"edrag drag cursor-e-resize\" data-subplot=\"xy\" x=\"575.7\" y=\"197.5\" width=\"58.300000000000004\" height=\"20\" style=\"fill: transparent; stroke-width: 0; pointer-events: all;\"></rect><rect class=\"nsdrag drag cursor-ns-resize\" data-subplot=\"xy\" x=\"30.5\" y=\"46.7\" width=\"20\" height=\"133.6\" style=\"fill: transparent; stroke-width: 0; pointer-events: all;\"></rect><rect class=\"sdrag drag cursor-s-resize\" data-subplot=\"xy\" x=\"30.5\" y=\"180.3\" width=\"20\" height=\"16.7\" style=\"fill: transparent; stroke-width: 0; pointer-events: all;\"></rect><rect class=\"ndrag drag cursor-n-resize\" data-subplot=\"xy\" x=\"30.5\" y=\"30\" width=\"20\" height=\"16.7\" style=\"fill: transparent; stroke-width: 0; pointer-events: all;\"></rect></g></g><g class=\"layer-below\"><g class=\"imagelayer\"></g><g class=\"shapelayer\"></g></g><g class=\"cartesianlayer\"><g class=\"subplot xy\"><g class=\"layer-subplot\"><g class=\"shapelayer\"></g><g class=\"imagelayer\"></g></g><g class=\"minor-gridlayer\"><g class=\"x\"></g><g class=\"y\"></g></g><g class=\"gridlayer\"><g class=\"x\"><path class=\"xgrid crisp\" transform=\"translate(109.3,0)\" d=\"M0,30v167\" style=\"stroke: rgb(48, 54, 61); stroke-opacity: 1; stroke-width: 1px;\"></path><path class=\"xgrid crisp\" transform=\"translate(225.9,0)\" d=\"M0,30v167\" style=\"stroke: rgb(48, 54, 61); stroke-opacity: 1; stroke-width: 1px;\"></path><path class=\"xgrid crisp\" transform=\"translate(342.5,0)\" d=\"M